      "meaning": "Own compact nonhuman cat template; broad head/pointed ears/tiny torso and short limbs. Every palette color is from actual standing PNG. Fixed limb lengths chosen before own short-reach fixture. No Explorer anatomy scaling.",
      "standingRuler": "Common80/4.6 scale unchanged; head width.78source/13.565world remains close to original14px. V3 ear tip.82 versus v2.73 raises maximum by.09source/~1.565world. Head+ear Zspan11.826world versus original11head rows, total seated17.478world versus original16px, not exact sprite parity. No avatar/camera/view scaling.",
